## 2. 🛡️ SOC Analyst (Networking Fundamentals)

### Core Concepts Covered
- **The OSI Model (7 Layers):** Explored how data moves from the Physical layer up to the Application layer.
- **The TCP/IP Model (4 Layers):** Learned real-world internet architecture (Network Access, Internet, Transport, Application).
- **Packet Encapsulation:** Understood how data gets wrapped with headers as it travels down network layers.
- **SMB & Port Fundamentals:** Introduction to Server Message Block (SMB) and client-server communication over TCP/IP.

